-doc """
Compute SHA-3 / SHAKE in one call and return output bytes.

SHA-3 defaults to its digest size and permits shorter prefixes. SHAKE requires an explicit hash output
length.

Lengths are in bytes; states are immutable and must be replaced with each returned state.

```erlang
Output = libdecaf:xof_sha3(shake128, <<"invoice-42">>, 16),
16 = byte_size(Output).
```
